      "title": "DD 1561 - FSA-R, Unaccompanied PCS to Okinawa",
      "description": "FSA-R for a married sergeant with a child ordered PCS to Okinawa where dependent travel is not authorized (command sponsorship denied): detached 1 Jun 26 with 10 days of leave and 4 days of proceed time, so FSA-R starts 15 Jun 26 (DoD FMR Vol 7A Ch 27 par 2.3.1.1.1, 4.1.1.1; Table 27-1 rule 2). Sample data - replace before use.",
